    "detailed_description": "Accident Liquidator is an exciting 3D arcade action-adventure game that throws you into situations where each day presents new challenges necessary for survival.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n- Story and Objectives:<br />\r\nYou find yourself in various emergency situations, and your goal is to survive. Every day you will face tasks related to survival.<br />\r\n- Top-Down View:<br />\r\nThe game is presented in a top-down view, allowing you to see the environment and plan your actions.<br />\r\n- Mouse Control:<br />\r\nYou control the character with the mouse. Just click on the location where you want to move the hero, and he will go there.<br />\r\n- 3D Graphics",
